And it's just... wild how failure-within-the-system is written about at-length as victory by so many [[id:2c857b0f-cb0b-4907-ad56-d94b88237018][American Progressivists]] and [[id:33b630c1-697a-47f9-a7d5-482689c8b078][Leftists]], while the people who should be some of their most direct opposition are not gloating about what is arguably a far greater victory, from their perspectives.

